# Output of the three drivers that run against the real local stack: scripts/e2e.mjs (the
# live API journal and per-route summary), scripts/flows.mjs (a screenshot per failed flow)
# and scripts/rehearse.mjs (a screenshot per runbook step plus results.json). The trailing
# `*` covers a run given its own --out, e.g. `.e2e-demo/` or `.rehearsal-dark/`.
.e2e*/
.flows*/
.rehearsal*/
